        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8114, 9 Inch Custom Sideplate Lockset, Emtek 8114</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 9 Inch Custom Sideplate Lockset is available in single cylinder, interconnected single cylinder, or dummy functions. This Modern Sideplate Lockset will fit standard 2-1/8 inch door preparations with door thicknesses ranging from 1-1/4 inches to  2-3/4 inches thick and with backsets of 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.  This custom side plate has matte black 9\" side plates on both sides.  The exterior has a Helios lever in black and the interior has a black T-Bar stem with a knurled lever in satin brass.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Large Modern Sideplate Lockset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass latch with saw-proof insert.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek Modern 9 Inch Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Bore Hole Spacing (distance between deadbolt and lever latch): 5-1/2\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 2-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: 1-1/4\" - 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Full 1\" Throw</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-8114-specifications.pdf?v=1704262346\"><b>Emtek 8114 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a knob/lever operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n<li><b>Interconnected Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn from the interior. The interior knob/lever opens the door without having to unlock the deadbolt for immediate egress.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a knob/lever operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a key unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-8114-finish.jpg?v=1704354621\" width=\"514\" height=\"115\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek 8114 Available Finishes\">\r\n</p>",
